    {
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Thanks for the run. The one red check is `te-ci/L0_pytorch_unittest--H100_1GPU`, and it does not come from this change. That same job is red on ten of the eleven most recently merged PRs, #3662 included, which landed a few hours ago, and it is red on #3655 as well. Every other variant here is green, A100 and B200 and both debug runs, and the uploaded log for the H100 job comes back as `<EMPTY LOG>` so there is nothing in it to act on from outside.\n\nNo test depends on these strings, for what it is worth. Searching the repo for `operation has` hits six source files and zero tests. The three outside this diff, `swiglu.py`, `activation.py` and `grouped_linear.py`, already carry the `f`, so the six here were the whole remainder.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:21:14Z",
